{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"compacted_at":1786722239994509001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"glass-worriless-mammal","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"9f49fde5da1b954a7b0823a8b19ff637ae300e0c306f40ef4818bca0458da831","event_uuid":"2c36c666-0c99-4ced-9fa6-595ea131a685","position":{"commit_sha":"ce1f5028c687618e9e5c74f6a8987cfa4e91abc0","position":"1786720415815192001-2c36c666-0c99-4ced-9fa6-595ea131a685"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"907f4d3b1ebdf8920daa4439e7a7db9e83310c57752ab803cc91296035b077e3","event_uuid":"5b7052b9-32a1-4534-ba0a-df29e0c448e4","position":{"commit_sha":"cab3e682a68a546136d13b47a998196d90b5daab","position":"1786720424518945001-5b7052b9-32a1-4534-ba0a-df29e0c448e4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786720415815192001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"5b7052b9-32a1-4534-ba0a-df29e0c448e4","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"708d-0767-1a51-4928"}],"description":"## Problem\nThe live Jira DC harness test tests/external/live_jira_dc/test_store_copy_isolation.py::test_the_store_copy_is_complete_and_scrubbed FAILS on current main:\n\n  AssertionError: binding/snapshot artifacts survived the scrub: ['.bridge_state']\n  assert ['.bridge_state'] == []\n\nObserved in the 'jira DC harness smoke' job of Live External Integration run 31807853902 (job 94790999602), 2026-08-14, against origin/main. The store-copy scrub step (from J11 / nonmystic-topiary-toadfish, epic e369) does not remove the .bridge_state directory, so a binding/snapshot artifact survives into the copied store the test asserts is fully scrubbed. Likely related to recent .bridge_state cache work (epic 0303).\n\n## Impact\nIndependent of the rich-text epic (vigilant-erasable-pony) — surfaced while running that epic's live DC-harness job. It makes the DC-harness job red on an unrelated cell, muddying the live signal for other work.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The store-copy scrub removes .bridge_state (and any equivalent binding/snapshot cache) so test_the_store_copy_is_complete_and_scrubbed passes in the live DC-harness job.\n- [ ] A root-cause note explains why .bridge_state began surviving the scrub (regression origin).\n\n## Notes\nDiscovered during orchestration of vigilant-erasable-pony's operator-dispatched live run; NOT a blocker for graywolf (whose own rich-text test is tracked separately).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"91aa-167f-1061-4f17","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Live DC store-copy scrub leaves .bridge_state behind (test_store_copy_isolation regression)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["2c36c666-0c99-4ced-9fa6-595ea131a685","5b7052b9-32a1-4534-ba0a-df29e0c448e4"]},"env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786722239994509001,"uuid":"0dd71880-2003-43f3-a61f-5df07510a279"}